WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.350
Here are the limits
the check holds GCC to.

2
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.138
Microsoft Learn's page on
the certificate revocation

3
00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:10.925
list gives them for public
Entra I D, which includes GCC.

4
00:00:10.925 --> 00:00:14.204
For interactive sign-in, a
revocation list must stay

5
00:00:14.204 --> 00:00:17.787
under twenty megabytes and
download within ten seconds.

6
00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:20.926
The service-side limit
is sixty-five megabytes.

7
00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:25.846
Learn gives those limits in megabytes;
the kit reads them as decimal megabytes,

8
00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:29.025
a million bytes each, which
is the stricter reading.

9
00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:34.225
There's no default cloud in the kit: you
name it every time, with cloud G C C.

10
00:00:34.225 --> 00:00:37.745
Two thresholds are the program's
design guidance, not Learn's:

11
00:00:37.745 --> 00:00:40.843
a warning at eighty percent
of the interactive limit,

12
00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:45.190
and a warning when an authority's
certificate expires within ninety days.
